			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2597e789-698d-5451-be66-98bf8673287b")
	)
	(text "Master relay K1 feeds the heaters ONLY (HEAT_12V). Fans and logic stay powered, so cooldown works in FAULT.\nK1 closes only in PREHEAT/RUN, before any heater gate turns on; it opens on any fault after the gates are low.\nR2 pulls RELAY_EN low: K1 is open at boot. D1 absorbs the coil kickback. See ADR-013, FMEA FM-01.\n\nHeater channel: fuse -> TCO -> PTC -> low-side MOSFET. TCO and PTC are on the duct, wired through J2/J3.\n10k gate pull-downs (R4, R6) are MANDATORY: heater off at boot, reset or floating pin (FMEA FM-04).\nIRLB8721 R_DS(on) is specified at V_GS = 4.5 V, not 3.3 V: confirm on the bench or add a gate driver (FMEA A3)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 203.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3faf9790-58f8-5e42-a9c1-e9f1c2ad0e3b")
	)
	(text "2. FANS (x2): 3A branch, 5V buck, high-side power cut, open-drain PWM, tach"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 228.6 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "27910715-2bcc-557c-a6e9-67b82211048e")
	)
