	(text "Fans and the buck converter run from 12V_AUX (own 3 A fuse), NOT through K1: fans must run in FAULT.\nPower cut: BC547 pulls the AO3401A gate down through the 10k/10k divider, so V_GS is about -6 V\n(part limit +/-12 V). 10k base pull-down keeps the fan off at boot.\nPWM: 2N7002 open-drain on the fan's PWM wire. Inverted: GPIO high = fan slower (invert in the HAL only).\nTach: 10k pull-up to 3V3 + 10 nF. Not 100 nF: that would smear ~450 Hz pulses at full speed.\nFans plug into J4/J5 (pin 1 GND, 2 +12V switched, 3 tach, 4 PWM). Check wire colours with a meter."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 411.48 96.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "26975206-0145-5500-a4a9-02eea3a3654c")
	)
